<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5964] Renaming and executing a note results in it being duplicated.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5964</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If a note is renamed by changing only the capitalization, the note is copied at the file system level when it is executed again.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Preconditions%3A&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Preconditions:&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A note, for example, named &quot;&lt;em&gt;note&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Stepstoreproduce%3A&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Steps to reproduce:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Rename the note &quot;&lt;em&gt;note&quot;&lt;/em&gt; to &quot;&lt;em&gt;Note&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Open and execute the note&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Expectedresult%3A&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Expected result:&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There is only one file &lt;em&gt;Note&lt;/em&gt; in the file system&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Observedresult%3A&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Observed result:&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There are two files in the file system:&#160;&lt;em&gt;Note&lt;/em&gt; and&#160;&lt;em&gt;note&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
